brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T71a,<h1>Digital Signage Outdoor 75&quot; IP65</h1><p>Explore our robust 75&quot; Outdoor Digital Signage IP65 in Dubai. Perfect for all weather. Boost your brand visibility today in UAE.</p><p><strong>Outdoor-rated 75&quot; display. IP65 weatherproof. Sunlight-readable.</strong></p><p>The Digital Signage Outdoor 75&quot; IP65 is a premium outdoor display engineered for durability and high performance, featuring a weatherproof IP65 rating and ultra-bright 3,000 nits screen for clear visibility in direct sunlight. Perfect for storefront advertising, public information in parks, and transport hubs, this 75-inch display resists rain, dust, and harsh environmental conditions, ensuring reliable, vibrant digital signage solutions in any outdoor setting.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What does the IP65 rating mean for this display?</h3><p>The IP65 rating ensures the 75&quot; display is fully protected against dust ingress and water jets from any direction, making it highly suitable for outdoor environments including rain and dusty conditions.</p><h3>Is the brightness of 3,000 nits sufficient for direct sunlight?</h3><p>Yes, with 3,000 nits brightness, this display is designed to be sunlight-readable, ensuring clear visibility even in bright outdoor environments.</p><h3>Can this display be installed in any outdoor location?</h3><p>The display is built for versatile outdoor installation including storefronts, parks, and transport hubs, but stable mounting and proper electrical wiring are required to ensure optimal performance.</p><h3>How does this outdoor display compare to indoor digital signage options?</h3><p>Unlike indoor models, this display features IP65 weatherproof protection and higher brightness levels, making it durable and visible in harsh outdoor conditions that indoor displays cannot withstand.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Digital Signage Outdoor 75\\\" IP65 | Brightluxx Dubai\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Explore our robust 75\\\" Outdoor Digital Signage IP65 in Dubai. Perfect for all weather. Boost your brand visibility today in UAE.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/digital-signage-outdoor-75\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/37aunjb6qe2jr.css\",\"precedence\":\